<title>UK: BICC yr pretax, pre-excep profit up 18 pct.</title>
<headline>BICC yr pretax, pre-excep profit up 18 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		13.0		   vs 9.4</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 8.5		    vs n/a</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 12.5		   vs n/a</p>
<p> Pretax		     129		    vs 109</p>
<p> Turnover		   4,669		  vs 4,362</p>
<p>NOTE - Cables and construction company BICC plc said the above turnover and profit numbers were before exceptional items. Total dividend, adjusted for a rights issue last September, was 12.41 pence.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
